 "name_en": "Statistical Sales Conditions (34B)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Statistical Sales Conditions (34B)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio04965256d91b47b19d36561079eb2693\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio04965256d91b47b19d36561079eb2693__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">To transfer statistical conditions from SD to Margin Analysis, you write the statistical condition values to extension ledger 0C. The transfer occurs via G/L accounts. The account key assigned to a statistical condition is posted to the G/L and marked as relevant for account determination in the pricing procedure. For example, a statistical cash discount is posted to the extension ledger during billing.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">To use this functionality for other statistical SD condition use cases (such as warranties and discounts), configure the following settings for the price condition: Select the Statistics indicator to ensure the condition is used for statistical purposes only; Assign an account key that defines two accounts (the Accruals key is not considered).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio04965256d91b47b19d36561079eb2693__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute picking</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check batches (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods issue</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing document</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio04965256d91b47b19d36561079eb2693__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer statistical conditions from SD to Margin Analysis</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get improved reporting with better visibility</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>统计销售条件 (34B)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio04965256d91b47b19d36561079eb2693\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio04965256d91b47b19d36561079eb2693__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">要将统计条件从 SD 传输到利润分析，请将统计条件值写入扩展分类账 0C。通过总账科目进行传输。分配给统计条件的科目代码将过账到总账，并在定价程序中标记为与科目确定相关。例如，在开票期间将统计现金折扣过账到扩展分类账。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">要将此功能用于其他统计 SD 条件用例（例如保修和折扣），请为价格条件配置以下设置：选择统计标识以确保条件仅用于统计目的；分配定义两个科目的科目代码（不考虑应计代码）。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio04965256d91b47b19d36561079eb2693__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行拣配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查批次（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账发货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio04965256d91b47b19d36561079eb2693__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将统计条件从 SD 传输到利润分析</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高可视性，优化报表</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
